+## 2026-11-28 — The one-line verdicts credit no helper session by name (S306p)
+
+**What happened.** Each arc ends in a one-line verdict. Seventy-nine of them, written since early November, named the
+helper sessions (the other seats) inside the claim itself. Main ruled that a verdict line names only main, with any other
+credit kept in a separate field of the same file. The building session re-worded the 79 lines that way, kept the credit
+in that field, left a dated note on each arc's page pointing to the old wording in the history, and added an automatic
+check, which reads the seats' names from a list that a new seat is added to. No result changed.
+
+0 of 19.
